		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Scales of black basalt cover this gigantic, wingless dragon. Greedy masters of the subterranean world.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 16, <strong>HP</strong> 53, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 rend +7 (2d8) or 1 petrifying gout, <strong>MV</strong> double near (burrow, fly), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 11</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Imperious</strong>. Fire immune. Shapechange and assume the form of a humanoid.</p><p></p><p><strong>Petrifying Gout</strong>. A straight line (5' wide) extending double near from dragon. CON 15+ or petrified.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
